## Verification Plan

### Automated & API Tests
1. Test student auth login endpoint with `student@sgit.edu`.
2. Test GET & PUT `/api/student/profile`.
3. Test GET & POST `/api/student/academic/semester`.
4. Test GET & POST `/api/student/cgpa/calculate`.

### Manual End-to-End Verification (Persistence Test)
1. Login as demo student (`student@sgit.edu` / `SgitStudent@1997`).
2. Navigate to Academic Progress (`/academic-progress`).
3. Add subjects with marks & credits for Semester 1 & Semester 2.
4. Verify auto-calculated grades and SGPA.
5. Click **SAVE PROGRESS**.
6. Calculate CGPA on `/cgpa-calculator`.
7. Log out.
8. Log in again.
9. Open `/academic-progress` and verify all semester data, subjects, marks, grades, and SGPA are intact.
10. Refresh the browser and confirm data survives.
11. Navigate to `/dashboard` and verify the CGPA summary card displays updated metrics.
